  "id": "fields-thinned",
  "title": "Fields 2025 \u2014 thinned field polygons (test)",
  "description": "TEST \u2014 every 2025 Fields of the World PRUE field polygon (1.58B), z0\u201313, through tylertoo's generalization ladder from z0 (density thinning + simplification + tile-size cap). Layer `fields` with per-field `area` (m\u00b2), `confidence` (0\u2013100, sparse), `country`, `state`. Built pre-dedupe (issue #9) and unfiltered; superseded by the per-year handover archives once they land. Styles: plain boundaries (default), per-field confidence, per-field size.",
